{"id": "tcl-2026-09-13-005", "date": "2026-09-13", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Sun"}, "entities": {"companies": ["tcl", "csot"], "customers": ["tcl"], "suppliers": ["csot"]}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["mass production"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.9, "reasons": ["多公司提及", "供應鏈上下游同時提及"]}, "title": "TCL says its OLED inkjet printing process has reached the point of \"stable mass production\"", "content": "<p>In July, we <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/tcl-csot-starts-producing-27-4k-inkjet-printed-oled-monitor-panels-its-55-gen\">reported</a> that TCL CSOT has began to commercially produce consumer inkjet printed OLED panels, for laptops and monitors. The company has now announced that its inkjet printing process has reached the point of \"stable mass production\".</p><img src=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/inline-images/MSI-Pro-Max-OLED-271UPJW12.jpg\" data-entity-uuid=\"1c16d9e3-2", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/tcl-says-its-oled-inkjet-printing-process-has-reached-point-stable-mass", "type": "rss"}]}
